<title>HONG KONG: SCMP (Holdings) interim net HK$379 mln.</title>
<headline>SCMP (Holdings) interim net HK$379 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)		21.92    vs  28.46</p>
<p>    Second int div (H.K. cents) 6.0	vs  6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	     nil	vs  180.99 gain</p>
<p>    Net				 379.35   vs  426.85</p>
<p>    Turnover			  1,179.22 vs  611.66</p>
<p>    Company name		    South China Morning Post</p>
<p>					  (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		     March 5-7</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		March 14</p>
<p>NOTE - South China Morning Post publishes the South China Morning Post newspaper and other publications.</p>
<p>The turnover has been expanded following the acquisition of TVE (Holdings) Ltd and its group of companies in April 1996. The turnover figure in respect of the last corresponding period has been restated to include gross rental income.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
